{
  "title": "VPC · SAA-C03 개념 위키",
  "description": "Region 범위의 논리적으로 격리된 가상 네트워크다.",
  "main": "<nav class=\"breadcrumb\" aria-label=\"현재 위치\"><a href=\"/concepts/\">개념 위키</a><span aria-hidden=\"true\">/</span><span>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span></span></nav><div class=\"wiki-layout\"><aside class=\"wiki-toc\"><details open><summary>이 문서의 목차</summary><nav aria-label=\"문서 목차\"><ol><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#overview\">개요</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#vpc-cidr\">VPC CIDR</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#subnet\">Subnet</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#route-table\">Route Table</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#network-security\">Network Security</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#dns-and-dhcp\">DNS and DHCP</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#connectivity\">Connectivity</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#default-vpc\">Default VPC</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#scenario\">적용 예시</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#references\">AWS 공식 문서</a></li><li><a href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#practice\">연관 문제 5개</a></li></ol></nav></details><a class=\"back-index\" href=\"/concepts/\">← 전체 개념 보기</a></aside><div class=\"wiki-main\"><article class=\"term-article\"><header class=\"article-header\"><div class=\"term-meta\"><span>네트워크</span><span>57 / 62</span></div><h1>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span></h1><p class=\"article-date\">공식 문서 확인 2026-09-30 · 7 subtopics</p></header><section id=\"overview\" class=\"overview\"><h2>개요</h2><p>Amazon VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>에서 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span> 주소 범위, 경로, 네트워크 경계와 연결 방식을 정의하는 논리적 네트워크다. 사용자가 관리하는 한 프로세스나 물리 NIC를 의미하지 않는다.</p><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">Region</a>에 속하고 그 안의 Subnet은 하나의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다. 리소스가 서로 통신하려면 주소와 Route, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>, 서비스 권한까지 필요한 경계를 모두 통과해야 한다.</p></section><section class=\"visual\" aria-label=\"웹 계층과 서비스 접근 경로\"><figure class=\"diagram\"><figcaption><b>웹 계층과 서비스 접근 경로</b></figcaption><div class=\"diagram-body\"><div class=\"visual-lanes\"><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Inbound</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Internet</strong><small>외부 Client</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> → <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a></strong><small>Public 진입</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small>앱 처리</small></div></div><div class=\"visual-lane\"><h3>Private service access</h3><div class=\"node navy\"><strong>Private <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></strong><small>서비스 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> 요청</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node blue\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a></strong><small>지원 Private 경로</small></div><div class=\"arrow\" aria-hidden=\"true\">↓</div><div class=\"node navy\"><strong><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/s3/\">S3</a> / AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span> service</strong><small><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/iam/\">IAM</a>·Policy도 확인</small></div></div></div><p class=\"diagram-note\">Route, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>과 API <span class=\"full-name\">(Application Programming Interface)</span> Permission은 별도의 조건이다.</p></div></figure></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"vpc-cidr\"><h2>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> CIDR <span class=\"full-name\">(Classless Inter-Domain Routing)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#vpc-cidr\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>의 IPv4 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 4)</span>·IPv6 <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol version 6)</span> 주소 공간을 정의한다. 연결할 다른 VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>나 On-premises와 겹치지 않게 계획하는 것이 중요하다. 주소가 겹치면 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> 같은 연결 방식이 막히거나 경로가 모호해진다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"subnet\"><h2>Subnet<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#subnet\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> 주소 범위의 일부를 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 배치한 단위다. Public 또는 Private 여부는 이름보다 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a>과 실제 연결 조건으로 결정된다. 계층별 Subnet을 나누면 경로와 네트워크 정책을 별도로 관리하기 쉽다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"route-table\"><h2>Route Table<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#route-table\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>목적지 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>과 다음 경로 대상의 관계를 정의한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT Gateway</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a> 등이 대상이 된다. Route가 있다는 것과 해당 통신을 허용하는 것은 별개다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"network-security\"><h2>Network Security<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#network-security\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/sg/\">Security Group</a>은 주로 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/eni/\">ENI</a> 연결 리소스에, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nacl/\">Network ACL</a>은 Subnet 경계에 적용된다. VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> Flow Logs로 허용·거부된 네트워크 흐름을 분석할 수 있다. Flow Log가 애플리케이션의 전체 Payload를 기록하는 것은 아니다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"dns-and-dhcp\"><h2>DNS <span class=\"full-name\">(Domain Name System)</span> and DHCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#dns-and-dhcp\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/#dns-resolution\">DNS Resolution</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Hostnames 설정은 서비스 이름 조회와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#endpoint-policy-and-private-dns\">Private DNS</a> 사용에 영향을 준다. DHCP <span class=\"full-name\">(Dynamic Host Configuration Protocol)</span> Option Set은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a> Server 등 네트워크 설정을 제공한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/#interface-endpoint\">PrivateLink</a> 연결에서는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/route53/\">DNS</a>가 어떤 주소를 반환하는지까지 확인한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"connectivity\"><h2>Connectivity<a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#connectivity\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p><a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a>는 인터넷 연결, <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">Direct Connect</a>는 Hybrid 연결, Peering과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">Transit Gateway</a>는 네트워크 간 연결에 사용한다. <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">VPC Endpoint</a>는 지원 서비스에 대한 Private 접근 경로를 만든다. 전체 네트워크 연결과 특정 서비스 접근을 구분한다.</p></section><section class=\"wiki-section\" id=\"default-vpc\"><h2>Default VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span><a class=\"heading-link permalink\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#default-vpc\" aria-label=\"이 항목으로 이동\">#</a><a class=\"citation\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/#reference-1\" aria-label=\"공식 출처 1\">[1]</a></h2><p>기본 VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>는 AWS <span class=\"full-name\">(Amazon Web Services)</span>가 기본 Subnet과 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/igw/\">Internet Gateway</a> 등 시작 구성을 제공한 환경이다. Custom VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span>는 주소·경로를 직접 구성한다. 기본 설정의 편리함이 곧 요구한 보안 분리와 동일한 것은 아니다.</p></section><section id=\"scenario\" class=\"scenario\"><h2>적용 예시</h2><p>웹 계층은 Public <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/elb/#application-load-balancer\">ALB</a>, 앱·DB <span class=\"full-name\">(Database)</span> 계층은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/#private-subnet\">Private Subnet</a>으로 두고 필요한 Outbound와 서비스 접근만 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/nat/\">NAT</a> 또는 Endpoint로 제공한다.</p></section><aside class=\"tip\"><b>시험에서 구별할 점</b><p>VPC <span class=\"full-name\">(Virtual Private Cloud)</span> 전체가 단일 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 갇혀 있지 않다.</p></aside><section id=\"references\" class=\"references\"><h2>AWS 공식 문서</h2><p>위 첨자는 아래 공식 문서로 연결됩니다. 서비스 제공 조건은 확인일 기준입니다.</p><ol><li id=\"reference-1\"><a href=\"https://docs.aws.amazon.com/vpc/latest/userguide/what-is-amazon-vpc.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">vpc/latest/userguide/what-is-amazon-vpc.html ↗</a></li></ol></section></article><section id=\"practice\" class=\"related-questions\"><div class=\"section-heading\"><div><p class=\"eyebrow\">PRACTICE · ENGLISH</p><h2>연관 문제 5개</h2></div><a href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q005\" data-question=\"Q005\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"0\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q005</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q005/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company plans to create one subnet in each of two Availability Zones. Which resource contains the network address range for those subnets?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">A VPC</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">An EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">A network ACL</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q005\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">An ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 A</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a>는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/region/\">리전</a> 범위이고 그 안의 각 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>은 한 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>에 속한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q022\" data-question=\"Q022\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"2\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q022</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q022/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A company wants to quickly establish an encrypted tunnel between its on-premises network and AWS over the internet. Which service should it choose?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS CloudFormation</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon FSx</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">AWS Site-to-Site VPN</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q022\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Amazon EFS</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 C</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/#site-to-site-vpn\">Site-to-Site VPN</a>이 IPsec 터널을 제공한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/hybrid/\">VPN / Direct Connect</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q094\" data-question=\"Q094\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"1\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q094</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q094/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">One VPC uses 10.0.0.0/16 and a VPC it must connect to uses 10.0.1.0/24. What prevents VPC peering between them?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">The presence of route tables</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The CIDR ranges overlap</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">The VPCs are in different AZs</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q094\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Each VPC has an ENI</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 B</strong> · 겹치는 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>은 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">피어링</a> 연결에 사용할 수 없다. 주소 계획부터 바꿔야 한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/vpc/\">VPC</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q008\" data-question=\"Q008\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q008</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q008/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A route table has 10.0.0.0/16 to a peering connection and 10.0.1.0/24 to a local target. Which principle determines the route for 10.0.1.25?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Shortest prefix match</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">The route created first</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Compare only the last octet</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q008\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Longest prefix match</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · 목적지 전체 IP <span class=\"full-name\">(Internet Protocol)</span>와 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">CIDR</a>을 비교해 더 구체적인 일치 경로를 우선한다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/routes/\">Route Table</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/peering/\">VPC Peering</a></div></article><article class=\"question-card\" id=\"question-Q002\" data-question=\"Q002\" data-revision=\"1\" data-correct=\"3\"><div class=\"question-top\"><span class=\"question-no\">Q002</span><span class=\"type-label\">1개 선택</span><a class=\"question-link\" href=\"/concepts/quiz/q002/\">문제 전용 화면</a></div><h3 lang=\"en\">A web tier must withstand a data center failure within one Region. Which deployment is most appropriate?</h3><fieldset><legend>정답을 선택하세요</legend><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"0\"><span class=\"option-letter\">A</span><span lang=\"en\">Two ENIs on the same EC2 instance</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"1\"><span class=\"option-letter\">B</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances using one EBS volume</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"2\"><span class=\"option-letter\">C</span><span lang=\"en\">Two instances in a single Availability Zone</span></label><label class=\"option\"><input type=\"radio\" name=\"answer-Q002\" value=\"3\"><span class=\"option-letter\">D</span><span lang=\"en\">Instances deployed across different Availability Zones</span></label></fieldset><div class=\"question-actions\"><button class=\"check-answer\" type=\"button\">채점하기</button><button class=\"reset-answer\" type=\"button\">선택 지우기</button><span class=\"feedback\" role=\"status\" aria-live=\"polite\"></span></div><details class=\"explanation\"><summary>정답과 해설</summary><p><strong>정답 D</strong> · <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>는 독립적인 장애 영역이다. 서로 다른 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a>의 <a class=\"term-link\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">서브넷</a>에 웹 인스턴스를 둔다.</p></details><div class=\"question-tags\"><span>연결 개념</span><a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/az/\">AZ</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/subnet/\">Subnet / CIDR</a> <a class=\"tag\" href=\"/concepts/terms/ec2/\">EC2</a></div></article></section><nav class=\"sequence\" aria-label=\"용어 이동\"><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/tgw/\">이전 용어 <b>Transit Gateway</b></a></span><span><a href=\"/concepts/terms/endpoint/\">다음 용어 <b>VPC Endpoint</b></a></span></nav></div></div>"
}
